0.1.0 (2026-11-25):
- Fixed: the default variable name was the same for every node added in one editor session
- Variable scope: global or flow (new nodes: global, existing nodes keep flow) + context stores
- payload.count is also sent with the panic state
- Message properties (e.g. msg.topic) are kept
- New modern edit dialog (sections, live summary, spinners, validation), palette category "AFYA",
  Font Awesome icon, English UI with English + Polish help
- Short, consistent node status (value · time)
- MIT license, Node-RED >= 3.0, Node.js >= 18, unit tests (`npm test`)

0.0.6:
- last call date added into node status
0.0.5:
- cleaning
- change the variable name from answerOk to answerPanic, and answerFalse to answerDontPanic
- adding node states


0.0.4 and below:
- first versions of the add-on with minor preliminary changes
